# User agents and processes
USER-AGENT,AppleNews*
USER-AGENT,AppleTV*
USER-AGENT,com.apple.news*
USER-AGENT,com.apple.trustd*
USER-AGENT,com.apple.tv*
PROCESS-NAME,LookupViewService
